<title>USA: Bulldog group holds 6.2 pct DUSA stake.</title>
<headline>Bulldog group holds 6.2 pct DUSA stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group including Bulldog Capital Management LP, a Clearwater, Fla., investment adviser, said it has acquired a 6.2 percent stake, or 581,500 common shares, in DUSA Pharmaceuticals Inc.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said it paid $6.59 million for the stake and holds it for investment.</p>
</text>
